 his goal all along in love and  thunder eternity is a being at the  center of the universe who will grant  the individual who finds it a single  wish and even though he's dying gore  still has enough life in him to see his  plan through to the end thor and jane  follow him into eternity where jane  collapses and thor admits gore has won  yet it's not clear why it has to be that  way after all gore no longer has the  power of the necrosword so it seems thor  could easily kill him before he made his  wish saving himself in the process plus  with gore out of the way presumably  gore's wish would pass to thor and he  could wish jane's cancer away saving her  and enabling them to pursue their  rekindled romance instead the pair  convinces gore to wish for his daughter  to live instead of all gods to die which  ensures thor's survival believes jane to  perish why would thor choose to spare  the life of his enemy instead of killing  him in cold blood well as he says in  thor ragnarok because that's what heroes  do  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

